acceptance_criteria: guide-shell package docs are explicit about installation; docs+skills stay progressive-disclosure; stale-docs gate enforces guide-shell prerequisites; focused docs/help tests pass.
parent: pm-rnpb
release: v2026.5.18
resolution: "Closed after guide-shell package prerequisite was made explicit in docs, skills, help, and docs-skills gate."
expected_result: Docs and skills no longer imply pm guide is available in bare core; agents get copy-paste guide-shell install guidance.
actual_result: "Focused docs/help tests, docs-skills gate, isolated package-enabled calendar smoke, and full release gate with required Sentry/telemetry passed."
