comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-05-09T15:01:04.019Z",codex-agent,"Duplicate-check evidence: ran pm context --limit 10,pm search docs skills guide --limit 10,pm list-open --limit 20,and pm list-in-progress --limit 20. Existing similar docs efforts were already closed,so this request needs a new dedicated task under pm-rnpb."
  "2026-05-09T15:45:24.435Z",codex-agent,"Workstreams complete: docs routed through pm guide topics; added agentskills-compliant bundles (pm-developer, pm-user, pm-extensions, pm-sdk) plus harness matrix; implemented scripts/release/docs-skills-gate.mjs and wired quality:docs-skills + run-gates step. Verification: focused regression suite (165 tests) passed; docs-skills gate passed; full release gates passed with --skip-telemetry-sentry; baseline run without skip failed only on external Sentry high-issue threshold (2 highs, telemetry ok)."
  "2026-05-16T20:47:15.072Z",codex-agent,"Evidence 2026-05-16: fixed GitHub issue #29 by making guide-shell installation explicit before every public/skill pm guide workflow and by tightening docs-skills gate to require the guide-shell prerequisite. Verification passed: focused guide/docs tests (31 tests), docs-skills gate, pm --help --explain smoke, isolated package-enabled calendar guide smoke, and full release gate with required Sentry/telemetry."
